--      question, extract the same so_qid and keep their tags array.
--   4. Join the mention counts to the tag lists on so_qid, UNNEST the tag array so
--      each tag inherits the question’s mention count, aggregate by tag, and return
--      the ten tags with the highest summed mention counts.

WITH mention_raw AS (
